          "type": "detail",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "content": "<p><strong>55 organic ingredients,</strong> juiced at peak ripeness and freeze-dried cold — concentrating nutrients without the sugar, fiber and water.</p><p>2,500mg organic oat beta glucan<br/><br/>2,400mg Greens Blend — barley grass juice, spirulina, chlorella<br/><br/>930mg Fruit & Vegetable Blend<br/><br/>360mg Phytonutrient Blend<br/><br/>Blend 32000B — nine enzymes for absorption</p>",
