          "settings": {
            "title": "Quality & testing",
            "content": "<p><strong>Made in the USA,</strong> sourced from American farms first. Every batch is tested twice — once before blending and once after. Non-GMO, no artificial sweeteners, under 1g of added sugar per serving.<br/><br/><strong>Every batch is tested twice </strong>— once before blending and once after. NanoGreens has also been independently laboratory-tested for antioxidant capacity, both in the canister and in blood plasma, by scientists at Columbia Phytotechnology. <a href=\"/pages/research\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"The Science Behind NanoGreens\"><strong>[View Study]</strong></a></p>",
